<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>In My Head</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Queens of the Stone Age</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Lullabies To Paralyze</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5cABednUSqT0uMbl1s2nN6</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.830" end="00:22.830" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.830" end="00:29.840">It's the cruelest joke to play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.840" end="00:36.670">I'm so high, i run in place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.670" end="00:43.210">Only a line, we separate, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.210" end="00:51.210" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.850" end="03:29.180">[02:43.27][01:40.89][01:26.78][00:44.24]I keep on playin our favorite song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.180" end="03:32.840">[02:46.79][01:44.32][01:30.26][00:47.69]I turn it up while you're gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.840" end="03:36.220">[02:50.24][01:47.79][01:33.74][00:51.28]It's all i got when you're in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.220" end="03:39.420">[02:53.75][01:51.18][01:37.06][00:54.52]and you're in my head so i need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.420" end="03:40.920">[02:56.46][01:54.02][01:39.92][00:57.33]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.280" end="01:12.320">You're the only thing i've got</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.320" end="01:19.430">that i can't seem to get enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.430" end="01:26.100">We collide for one embrace, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.100" end="01:34.100" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.130" end="02:37.130">Hurry up &amp; wait forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.320" end="03:45.320" /></div></body></tt>